[FINAL-TEXT] All the evidence is in. I have a complete picture.

**Summary of findings:**
- Router4: all three critical interfaces UP — eth0 (192.168.200.1, LAN), eth4 (192.168.15.2, → router5), eth5 (172.25.1.1, → router3); RIP converged with full routing table; both WAN peers reachable at 0% loss.
